      "created_at": "2026-02-26T15:23:22.802Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Is there a way to allocate a single line item in a purchase order to multiple expense accounts?</p>\n<p>Eg. Consulting Invoice:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>60% → Account: Professional Fees Expense</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>40% → Account: Training Expense</p>\n</li>\n</ul>",
