      "created_at": "2026-02-27T04:44:20.334Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Hi <a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/yn1088\">@YN1088</a></p>\n<p>Expense GL mapping is infact one to one relationship in between item and GL Account. It can be set on either item or item group, brand and finally company priority wise.</p>\n<p>The same service item can be booked multiple times in a PO with different Expense Account BUT system will always bring default one GL expense account as soon as item is loaded in child table. This is all manual drive.</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/a/a/aadf18a186409df26528543de5f1c39878f2adfa.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/aadf18a186409df26528543de5f1c39878f2adfa\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/a/a/aadf18a186409df26528543de5f1c39878f2adfa_2_690x324.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"onB9o1GaBA4e9jADatqgY944IdA\" width=\"690\" height=\"324\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/a/a/aadf18a186409df26528543de5f1c39878f2adfa_2_690x324.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/a/a/aadf18a186409df26528543de5f1c39878f2adfa_2_1035x486.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/a/a/aadf18a186409df26528543de5f1c39878f2adfa_2_1380x648.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"FAF8F5\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1744×820 65.6 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p>In order to automate this, client script may help.</p>",
